[12764]="70002C69\n1\tFind and enter the dangerous pass of Nan Wathren\tNan Wathren lies to the north-east of Trestlebridge. You should head to the pass of Nan Wathren to search for the source of Trestlebridge's troubles.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have explored the edge of Nan Wathren.\n",
[12765]="7002D45C\n1\tTalk to the door-man at the infiltrators' hideout and give him the password\tThe infiltrator hideout is in the village of Bree, south of the High Stair. A door-man stands out front and will only let you inside if you repeat the password. Benegar Longbottom overheard some shabbily-dressed Men talking about a secret group planning some evil surprise for Bree and wants you to infiltrate the infiltrators.\n",
[12766]="7004E48F\n1\tClear loose stones from the pass to the Men Angrún (total: 8)\tLoose stones can be found upon the northern pass to the Men Angrún in the Ironfold. Wishing to avoid passing through the lands of the King under the Mountain, Ingór has asked you to aid his company in clearing the way to the Men Angrún.\n2\tAttempt to break boulders that have fallen upon the pass to the Men Angrún\tFallen boulders can be found on the pass to the Men Angrún. After clearing a number of loose stones, you should now attempt to break the boulders that have fallen upon the pass to the Men Angrún.\n3\tTalk to Ingór\tIngór can be found on the pass to the Men Angrún. You have attempted to break the fallen boulders upon the pass to the Men Angrún, but they resisted your efforts. You should talk to Ingór.\n",
[12767]="70015E29\n1\tDefeat worms (total: 14)\tWorms can be found in the valleys east of Gwingris. Daegennan has asked you to help clear the routes between Rivendell and Gwingris of worms.\n2\tTalk to Daegennan at Gwingris\tDaegennan is at Gwingris, west of the worm-valleys. You should return to Daegennan in Gwingris.\n",
[12768]="7004137D\n1\tOrcs can be found throughout the Redhorn Lodes, Nud-Melek, and the Foundations of Stone. Your cousin Varthmath has asked you to defeat Orcs in the depths of Moria to teach them to fear the line of Beorn.\t\n2\tTalk to Varthmath at Orc-watch, among the Redhorn Lodes\tVarthmath is at the Orc-watch among the Redhorn Lodes.\n3\tFind an impressive landmark atop Zirakzigil, and roar your claim to the mountains\tVarthmath has asked you to find a location atop the slopes of Zirakzigil from where you can roar your claim to the mountains. He wanted you to find a suitably impressive landmark at which to roar.\n4\tTalk to Varthmath at Orc-watch, among the Redhorn Lodes\tVarthmath is at the Orc-watch in the Redhorn Lodes. You have done as Varthmath requested, and should now tell him of your success.\n",
